# Functional grouping in schematics

- Group symbols **by function** and keep each group spatially coherent.
- Common groups to separate:
  - **Power** (input protection, regulators, decoupling)
  - **Clock/Oscillator** (crystal/resonator, load caps, clock routing)
  - **MCU/Core logic**
  - **Interfaces** (USB/UART/I2C/SPI, connectors, level shifting)
- Place each functional block in a dedicated **side/corner/area** of the schematic page.
- Keep inter-block connections tidy and minimal; use labels when it improves readability.

